# Deflecting Palm (CR 609.7a, 615.5): any source may be chosen, your own included. Bot1 Shocks itself and, in response, chooses
# that Shock. Its 2 damage to Bot1 is prevented and the Palm deals that much to the source's controller - Bot1 again: 18.
# Bot2 is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Shock
Deflecting Palm
Island x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Shock.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Deflecting Palm.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Stack.Shock)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Life = 20
Prevented = 2 Shock > Bot1 by Deflecting Palm
